{"5089180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon of the Forgotten", "steam_appid": 5089180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5117580], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time is the only resource that matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no health bar. There is a clock, and it is always running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hit you take is seconds gone. Every wrong step, every trap, every enemy that reaches you first costs time you cannot get back. When the clock hits zero, the run is over. The only way to survive is to keep moving down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the exit. Decide what is worth the detour. Get out before the timer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >decides for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get stronger, then lose it all</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every floor you clear offers a choice. Build a run that works, push deeper than</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >last time, and start over when it ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find out what happened to them</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon has people in it. Talk to them, look for what they left behind,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and reach an ending that fits what you found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time as health — one resource for fighting, exploring and risking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-built floors, each with its own threat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat on a grid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent progression between runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English, Türkçe, Deutsch, Français, Español</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time is the only resource that matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no health bar. There is a clock, and it is always running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hit you take is seconds gone. Every wrong step, every trap, every enemy that reaches you first costs time you cannot get back. When the clock hits zero, the run is over. The only way to survive is to keep moving down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the exit. Decide what is worth the detour. Get out before the timer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >decides for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get stronger, then lose it all</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every floor you clear offers a choice. Build a run that works, push deeper than</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >last time, and start over when it ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find out what happened to them</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon has people in it. Talk to them, look for what they left behind,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and reach an ending that fits what you found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time as health — one resource for fighting, exploring and risking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-built floors, each with its own threat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat on a grid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent progression between runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English, Türkçe, Deutsch, Français, Español</p>", "short_description": "A turn-based roguelike where time is your health. Every hit costs seconds, and the clock never stops. Descend, get stronger, and find out how deep you can go before it runs out.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089180/7d8cee2e7feeb24259be99a0b5e0e2ccf65123f6/header.jpg?t=1787063682", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089180/1a29a72bafa99080925f19bf3f8267d2902850ce/capsule_2